We are super excited to announce another artist today for Camp Afro Foli Drum & Dance Retreat. This year camp will run in July on the 12th-14th. We will be at a new venue on the Sunshine Coast, located 500 metres from the beach! What a treat! Morning swims before classes and even breakfast will definitely be on the agenda. The other exciting thing is that this year all food will be catered including breakfast, morning tea and afternoon tea. So, no need to bring anything! You can even hire bedding to keep it super easy. We are really looking forward to experiencing this new venue and we know you are going to love it! So, if you have been wondering what Camp Afro Foli is going to be like this year. Here area few shots from last year! and if you know what camp is like because you come every year... then try and spot yourself in some of these unreleased images!! More to come!! Stay tuned!

